1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:04,076
Sailing and kayaking are included in your
stay at this Cancun resort.

2
00:00:04,206 --> 00:00:09,423
This is Dreams Sands Cancun, a five star
all-inclusive right on the beach.

3
00:00:09,553 --> 00:00:13,090
Kayaks wait on the sand, and beach
volleyball is included too.

4
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:17,197
There are four outdoor pools, with a swim-
up bar and a poolside bar.

5
00:00:17,327 --> 00:00:21,881
Dinner can be Italian, Asian, or Mexican,
and it is all included.

6
00:00:22,011 --> 00:00:24,406
Wake up to an ocean view from your room.

7
00:00:24,536 --> 00:00:28,473
Then book a spa day, with a steam room, a
sauna, and a hot tub.

8
00:00:28,603 --> 00:00:32,896
Guests rate it eight point four out of
ten, from one thousand seven hundred fifty

9
00:00:32,926 --> 00:00:33,910
reviews on Expedia.

10
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:36,324
The full tour is on my channel.
